        "text": "Per unsigned replies that read as the team's, the intake pivot carried an algae roller at the first few events and a coral ground intake later. Pose estimation failed on day one of the first event, leaving no auto score and no autos; after a replay that night the team moved to 6328's estimator and has had no localization issues since.",
